{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52294","headline":"诗（幷序） 五十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 五十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但看蛾（项改「茧」）作蛾（张改作「卵」），不忆蚕生箔。\n但看睡寐时，还将梦爲乐。\n蛾既不羡蚕，梦亦不爲乐。\n当作如是观，死生无好恶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}